            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Protected DNA comprising a single-stranded DNA (ssDNA) cassette is provided. Further provided are uses of the protected DNA, methods for producing protected DNA, products generated in performing such methods (including intermediate and final products), and kits for use in such methods.</p>
